<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Dataset Construction Details ‣ AgentEscapeBench: Evaluating Out-of-Domain Tool-Grounded Reasoning in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Stage 4: Value Instantiation via LLM</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Dataset Construction Details ‣ AgentEscapeBench: Evaluating Out-of-Domain Tool-Grounded Reasoning in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Stage 5: Deterministic Forward Execution</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Dataset Construction Details ‣ AgentEscapeBench: Evaluating Out-of-Domain Tool-Grounded Reasoning in LLM Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>Stage 6: Narrative Generation and Quality Filtering</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
